# frost_breath.txt: SP$ Tap (up to two target creatures), then DB$ Pump |
# Defined$ Targeted | KW$ HIDDEN This card doesn't untap during your next
# untap step. | Duration$ Permanent. Card.canUntap reads the hidden line
# (Card.java:4817), so the Bears stay tapped through ai's next untap step;
# Hill Giant, tapped but not targeted, untaps. Untap.doUntap then removes the
# line (Untap.java:157-161), which the module tests cover.
startturn human
advance 3
tapformana human 2 U
tapformana human 3 U
tapformana human 4 U
queue paygeneric U
queue paygeneric U
queue targets 5
castspell human 1
resolvestack
# Main1 -> ... -> Cleanup -> ai's Untap.
advance 10
